## .NET / C#
backend/**/bin/
backend/**/obj/
*.user
*.suo

# Angular build output gets copied here at publish time (see
# .github/workflows/deploy.yml) — never commit the compiled app itself.
backend/TaskManager.Api/wwwroot/*
!backend/TaskManager.Api/wwwroot/.gitkeep

## Node / Angular (root-level safety net; frontend/.gitignore also covers this)
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.angular/

## Editors / OS
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

## Secrets — never commit real connection strings, JWT keys, or tokens
**/appsettings.*.local.json
*.env
.env.*
